    "summary": "Errata to the [Insanity’s Ire](vsdata:ability/necrons.annihilation-legion.insanitys-ire) Stratagem.\n\nDuring your opponent's Shooting phase, it can be used after an enemy unit finishes shooting, provided that enemy unit targeted an **unengaged** **DESTROYER CULT** or **FLAYED ONES** unit of yours earlier in the phase.\n\nThat unit of yours then gets a **[surge move](vsdata:core-rule/surge-move)** of at most D6\".",
